     Domains or App Groups, so this file grants none of them. What that costs on the phone: Sign in
     with Apple and passkeys refuse (Google still works), and the Live Activity's shared container is
     absent (ThroProjectionStore treats that as the normal case). Every shipping build uses
     ThroDarts.entitlements and a team in the Apple Developer Program. -->
